### Passed Test Cases
1. |Case|:**login**
    ```
    FUNCTION do_login()
        username = request.form['username']
        password = request.form['password']
        IF user_manager.login(username, password)
            session['username'] = username
            REDIRECT TO dashboard
        ELSE
            REDIRECT TO login
        ENDIF
    END FUNCTION
    ```

2. |Case|:**logout**
    ```
    FUNCTION logout()
        session.pop('username', None)
        REDIRECT TO login
    END FUNCTION
    ```

3. |Case|:**view_notes**
    ```
    FUNCTION dashboard()
        IF 'username' in session
            notes = note_manager.get_notes(session['username'])
            RENDER dashboard.html with notes
        ELSE
            REDIRECT TO login
        ENDIF
    END FUNCTION
    ```

4. |Case|:**registration**
    ```
    FUNCTION register()
        IF request.method == 'POST'
            username = request.form['username']
            password = request.form['password']
            IF user_manager.register(username, password)
                REDIRECT TO login
            ENDIF
        ENDIF
        RENDER registration.html
    END FUNCTION
    ```

